From c37878c5fc7478e9faf7f1fa3554da0e98702863 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SyzAster Authors <syzaster@asterinas.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:54:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] distro, kernel: fix NixOS image installation, ptrace
 lock, and set_tid_address

Pin reproducible nixpkgs tarball, ensure loop partition device nodes
exist during NixOS installation, allow ttyS0 serial console, fix
PTRACE_TRACEME parent lock ordering deadlock under Yama, and fix
sys_set_tid_address panic when replacing clear_child_tid.
---
